            "text": "Different mammals have different thicknesses of medulla relative to the size of the kidney.",
            "source": {
              "qp": 13
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Fig. 6.1 shows the relationship between the mean thickness of the medulla in kidneys of different mammals and concentration of urine produced by the kidneys.",
